{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "4bb7ba1f811df6f1e55ec52f48e3d5e4933e954bc6e5340ffb6c457169ee2abb", "ja": "導火線、異常なし？", "zh": "导火线，毫无异状？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "1ae4134a3116f48cdaa8537e08942f3fc9152d70c17909baf51d432c13bd7685", "ja": "琴葉の気配りのおかげで、灼熱少女の\nレッスンは快調な滑り出しを見せる。そんな\n中、恵美は琴葉のわずかな表情の変化に\n気づくものの、口には出さなかった。\n頼もしいリーダーの元、士気が上がる面々。", "zh": "因为琴叶的细心体贴，\n『灼热少女』的训练顺利开始。\n此时，惠美发现琴叶细微的表情变化，\n但她没有多问。在可靠队长的带领下，\n所有人的士气节节升高。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "234ae2d9d6b6bdae77e00c2485d65a8d559188f963f41f225c950050569d5a23", "ja": "（今日から、灼熱少女のレッスンが始まる。\nユニットとしての完成度を上げていかないとな……）", "zh": "（『灼热少女』从今天开始训练，\n得逐步提升团体的完成度才行……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1001_017kth", "source_sha256": "04b988853f47902fb26a2693dcf42ba3561098b1b55cf04fb49e9ad4029ec66f", "ja": "{$P$}、おはようございます。", "zh": "{$P$}，早安。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "942f3b0cb8994582f12ea33e92972c703a513ae61657a7c9270af1f37d5cfa39", "ja": "おはよう、琴葉。早いんだな。レッスンが\n始まるまで、まだ少しあるけど……どうかしたのか？", "zh": "早啊，琴叶。你来得真早，\n训练还要过一会才开始……是有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "93852cc7eb84f4969d705a0a0ace2409744d81b92fb534432d03301db0611201", "ja": "はい。実は、今日のレッスン内容について、\n少し相談させてほしいことがあるんです。", "zh": "是的，其实是关于今天的训练内容，\n我想稍微跟你商量一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "0ba151b2db134942510a72eb46caaff67523db19939d19673844908eb4658c50", "ja": "みんなの予定を確認したんですけど、\n今日は海美ちゃんと恵美が、途中で抜けますよね？", "zh": "我确认过大家的行程，\n海美跟惠美今天会中途先离开对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1005_p", "source_sha256": "b04b1160cdcd1fdd2bb921cc3fe0393dbfcb13cd60cbf845529643f30412b30d", "ja": "ああ、そうなんだ。\nふたりとも、急な撮影が入ってしまって……。", "zh": "对，是这样没错。\n因为她们突然接到摄影工作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1006_017kth", "source_sha256": "8aee227b5b3d2334e2fd9a4807de85804eb81944b393137988b0a3725b8ab76b", "ja": "なので、練習のメニューをこういうふうに\n変えてみたらどうかと……確認してもらえますか？", "zh": "所以我想把练习内容稍微调整成这样，\n不知道行不行……可以麻烦你确认一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1007_p", "source_sha256": "3c5c8cca11318d2c2057dd5abdf441ec2a1ead2c2bcc6ded7c44e3feaa4f39aa", "ja": "ふむふむ。基礎練習の後は、全体曲の振り付けの\n確認だけする……か。うん、いいんじゃないか？", "zh": "我看看喔。基础练习过后，只确认全体合唱曲的舞步……\n嗯，挺不错的不是嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1008_p", "source_sha256": "1609f7caf67695bcc9476d06301f5c9f205dddafdebd9049e0e22631bf00ce01", "ja": "これならふたりの負担も減るし、効率も良くなる。\nさすが、琴葉はしっかりしてるな！", "zh": "这样既能减轻她们两个的负担，也能提高效率。\n不愧是琴叶，真是能干！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1009_017kth", "source_sha256": "cddfbb79bdc1cfe5f6509bc92eec41d3d185dd4082da0b75a06747d143ce8d00", "ja": "いえ、そんな……大したことじゃありません。", "zh": "哪里，你过奖了……这没什么大不了的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1010_017kth", "source_sha256": "737c3a876b469f4ed59f97df0c1d82aa7853c523bad6bb259449d41bdd33f2a1", "ja": "けど、せっかくリーダーを任せてもらったので。\n少しでもみんなの役に立ちたいんです！", "zh": "不过，既然被托付了队长的重责大任，\n我希望多少能帮上大家的忙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1011_p", "source_sha256": "9aef7b9c81cfd1a878247c53940ccd26c792e4a92fbc8ee714081856cec44597", "ja": "そうか、頼もしいな。\nそれじゃ、練習も頑張ろうな！", "zh": "这样啊，真是可靠。\n那练习也一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1012_017kth", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1013_020meg", "source_sha256": "64c45b4499542d55b100d8cc6b0ebfbb1f4282dfbc79379d02dcf7a800f1a529", "ja": "ワン、ツー、スリー、フォー……\nお～い、美也～？　ちょっとテンポ遅れちゃってるよ？", "zh": "1、2、3、4……\n喂～美也～！你有点掉拍了喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1014_042miy", "source_sha256": "3fac068efb81cd4cdc82bee43ad81f9b24c6ac9868d482b4a501e47ed886339a", "ja": "おお～、それは失礼しました～。\nでは、頑張って急いで動きますね～。とりゃ～っ。", "zh": "哦哦～真是不好意思～\n那么，我会努力动得快一点～嘿呀～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1015_020meg", "source_sha256": "afd98153eb4cf27e7b7945bd455266b9be92aca4eaad892b976b16e72efd0d36", "ja": "にゃははっ♪\nそれじゃ反復横跳びだって！", "zh": "呀哈哈♪\n那样就变成反复横跳了啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1016_017kth", "source_sha256": "500aa72e17411bd5b193cbbfe4dffc7ed25593885a936d4395c1eb9d351fe400", "ja": "ねえ、みんな。ちょっと早いけど、休憩にしようか。", "zh": "大家听我这边。虽然有点早，但我们休息一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1017_029umi", "source_sha256": "3bac3338a863be0a1d08818fd282c9c97b3bb9526377f530291cc48d96d18f7d", "ja": "えっ、もう休憩するの？\n私、まだ全然疲れてないよ！", "zh": "咦？已经要休息了吗？\n我还一点都不累喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1018_017kth", "source_sha256": "c1ee5cf0bb921a4319da536369ab0dfa7727c9396c1aea8491c11eb592aaab8a", "ja": "ふふっ、海美ちゃんは体力があるんだね！\nでも、できれば5人の足並みをそろえたいし……。", "zh": "呵呵，海美体力真好！\n但是可以的话，我希望我们五个人的步调尽量统一……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1019_017kth", "source_sha256": "6ceafcc6fd805cc548a8e11e1632214e5a182662cfb4188afc5ae6491b9485ed", "ja": "それに、疲れを意識してから休むより、こまめに\n休憩したほうが効率が落ちなくていいらしいから。", "zh": "再说了，与其等感到疲倦才休息，\n时常休息似乎更好喔，这样效率才不会降低。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1020_040tam", "source_sha256": "45e2c70298866c803bae899ec4f90f3e6cb61f49de7cd11f432ee6db84904301", "ja": "おおー……ことは、すごーい！\n先生みたいなこと言ってる！", "zh": "哦哦……琴叶好厉害～！\n说的话好像老师！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1021_017kth", "source_sha256": "382bc1b098d04ff687033c3e57b088c02587ffe04c6cb08aec6e8fe44cadd5a8", "ja": "そ、そんなことないよ。\n本に書いてあったことの受け売りだし……。", "zh": "没、没有啦。\n我只是拿书上写的现学现卖而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1022_017kth", "source_sha256": "28d3c1346bba5ab43f23af2e27718e1217897e2ce6e49e331f616cf432d589c4", "ja": "あ、それと美也？　さっきのところだけど、たぶん\n途中じゃなくて、動き始めが一拍ずれてて……。", "zh": "啊，还有美也，刚才那个地方应该不是途中掉拍，\n而是开始跳的时候就慢了一拍……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1023_042miy", "source_sha256": "75703dec204ea50fdd91a8b08980f859194b48d7c492ba8dd403b0017f89bd36", "ja": "なんと、そうでしたか～。\nでは、少し早く入るようにしてみますね～。", "zh": "居然是这样吗～\n那我会试着早一点开始跳～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1024_p", "source_sha256": "785046573a1ffcfefea0066f684ccc8eef1f821bb2035dd65a6577bb2ce4a1a1", "ja": "（琴葉、みんなのことをよく見ているな。\nしっかり準備もしてきてくれたし……）", "zh": "（琴叶很仔细观察大家呢。\n而且她还事先做足了准备……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1025_p", "source_sha256": "4131450796d08df05029c03949446e6da71e1b9078394ae6fe84a9bc3c86318b", "ja": "（おかげで、予定よりもかなり進んでいる。\n俺が口を挟むまでもないくらいだ）", "zh": "（托她的福，进度比预期的快，\n甚至不需要我多嘴提醒。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1026_040tam", "source_sha256": "dec736cb7627fabf0aade7f6cc4f5039c937b414eff52cae77f36e1b6dcf6dc1", "ja": "あっ、おやぶ～ん！\nたまき、もうおどれるようになったよ！　みてみて！", "zh": "啊，老大～！\n环已经能把舞跳好了喔！你快看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1027_029umi", "source_sha256": "45865ed88d0ed31325f3181a239e144f0d05dbdab3c94f0e15e900f027f6fa8c", "ja": "私も私もっ！　いくよ環、せ～のっ！\nイチ、ニ、サン、シ……。", "zh": "我也是、我也是！要一起跳啰，环，预备～开始！\n一、二、三、四……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1028_040tam", "source_sha256": "231ac8a511737ac4689ee9f17dbaafc98806568f63cf9124534b506eeef5966d", "ja": "ごー、ろく、しち、はち……じゃーん！", "zh": "五、六、七、八……锵锵──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1029_029umi", "source_sha256": "4fcba6dfd67ca89a8d9a327a983243fc518c39579de49c7281276df33718187c", "ja": "へへっ、どうどう？\n{$P$}、スゴいでしょ！？", "zh": "嘿嘿，怎么样、怎么样？\n{$P$}，我们很厉害对吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1030_p", "source_sha256": "998bfc3d5ef4c453641b3acade3c0eaad54775ad3d55c99da2776c07df04002c", "ja": "うん、ふたりとも、さすがだな！\n初日なのに、もう形になってるじゃないか。", "zh": "嗯，你们两个真厉害！\n这才第一天，你们已经跳得有模有样了嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1031_017kth", "source_sha256": "672c94d65b5e010346522df8e02f8f320832582623b749ea6a7f517dfe09c60c", "ja": "ふふっ。海美ちゃんも環ちゃんも、すごいんですよ！\n教えたこと、どんどん吸収していって……。", "zh": "呵呵，海美跟小环都很厉害喔！\n教她们什么都能快速吸收……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1032_040tam", "source_sha256": "fc9da13738ad8e2a4ca028c3a9eaffee89370c5a46172f7f34a72b063aac5c1f", "ja": "ほんと？　たまき、すごい？", "zh": "真的吗？环很厉害吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1033_017kth", "source_sha256": "44d54a1634eeb9f896acd5bd1e367da9eba766f491c950ea79897567e0e9bb73", "ja": "うん！　私、ふたりのこと、尊敬……は堅いかな。\nえっと、とってもすごいなって思ってるよ。", "zh": "嗯！我很尊敬你们……这么说好像太正经八百了。\n该怎么说呢，我觉得你们非常厉害喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1034_040tam", "source_sha256": "79b5df7e68d4eec3c5984ec9bf17272887b038d6102e352fa4c85ca9a3dc64df", "ja": "くふふ……ことはにほめられちゃった！\nたまき、すっごくうれしいぞ！", "zh": "呵呵……被琴叶称赞了！\n环非常高兴喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1035_040tam", "source_sha256": "81381056e396f146282af09792c4edc75c8b3fd858ff766d728fe8073c76515c", "ja": "ことは、たまき、もっともっとがんばる！\nだからたまきに、いっぱい教えて！", "zh": "琴叶，环会更更更努力！\n所以再多教教环吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1036_017kth", "source_sha256": "27633d89676179cbde6b9d0ab1dab1d2985a9ae4367ba432d7c7f210ef3e3366", "ja": "もちろんだよ、環ちゃん。一緒に頑張ろうね！", "zh": "当然好呀，小环。我们一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1037_017kth", "source_sha256": "503e97f2a278107babe68f90541b288c1a7788205a351c7ff7b722210f49e62f", "ja": "私も、これ以上環ちゃんやみんなに遅れないように、\nもっと頑張らなくちゃだから……。", "zh": "因为我也得更努力，\n免得落后小环跟其他人才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1038_020meg", "source_sha256": "586974d163412956b8b217bd0890c20d6020dce8c9d264668864ef6f48b981d5", "ja": "ん……んん？", "zh": "嗯……嗯嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1039_042miy", "source_sha256": "3a320ce68c3b984e40c901165486dc29590191918b8b66cc8f4f36a329f5158d", "ja": "？　恵美ちゃん、どうかしましたか～？", "zh": "咦？惠美，怎么了吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1040_020meg", "source_sha256": "653483bb59c929bca649c8216dc68bb80e666a18b50b9de749dcb439a480fef2", "ja": "あ、ううん！\n別に、大したコトじゃ、ないんだけど……。", "zh": "啊，没事！\n不是什么大不了的事啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1041_p", "source_sha256": "b2e855a78c31a1d2242bdc0610fa168e201bda5a38ae07c2a749e70162977425", "ja": "おっと、そろそろ移動の時間だな。恵美、海美、\n行こうか。琴葉、すまないが後は頼んでもいいか？", "zh": "啊，差不多该出发了。惠美、海美，我们走吧。\n琴叶，抱歉，接下来可以拜托你吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1042_017kth", "source_sha256": "e5ff72f68bd3422e7df927d1efc3d05da2b699247d8900eaa14f9a04ae1e033f", "ja": "はいっ、わかりました。\nいってらっしゃい、ふたりとも！", "zh": "好的，我明白了。\n你们两个路上小心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1043_029umi", "source_sha256": "955e007316cfe9442c69bc2cc115c5a896fa476555c6b29d9e841ae44a686383", "ja": "んふふふふ……♪　灼熱少女、楽しいな～！\n早く本番来ないかなーっ☆", "zh": "呵呵呵呵呵……♪『灼热少女』真开心～！\n正式表演能不能快点到呢～☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1044_020meg", "source_sha256": "232b76133f42bf52b2aef0137166ecfaf5de41b0eb3ec54c8d1a5a7d3d4469f2", "ja": "海美ってば、気が早すぎ！\nまだレッスン初日だよ？", "zh": "海美你喔，也太心急了吧！\n今天才第一天训练而已耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1045_029umi", "source_sha256": "cbf29836c31b3fa121f2e8aec3c59d364076d423b9476c6caf9e3e88bb225d57", "ja": "だってだって、楽しみなんだもんっ！\nそれにさ、琴葉ってすごいよね～？", "zh": "可是可是，真的很开心嘛！\n而且呀，琴叶真的很厉害对吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1046_029umi", "source_sha256": "de61c058d62d125ef9dbe0c9550e6e3cdfd4974e20b40eec7b9fad450471c00d", "ja": "まだレッスン始まったばっかりなのに、どの曲も\nほとんどバッチリだった！　いつの間に覚えたんだろ？", "zh": "明明才刚开始训练，却每首歌都跳得近乎完美！\n她什么时候学会的呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1047_029umi", "source_sha256": "38c7faf33955b7cfd120ee802e7cfac2b34a47880cc8c6019a69937e03a21908", "ja": "環や私のレッスンも見てくれるし……\nなんかもう、すっごく頼れるお姉さんって感じ！", "zh": "她还会指导我跟环的训练……\n感觉真的是非常可靠的大姊姊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1048_020meg", "source_sha256": "29f0a2ee767c945a15b34057dd591f43d50decb965a5ecbc1950c8aa7d8916c2", "ja": "でしょ～！？　ま、琴葉はカンペキだからね♪\nさすが委員長、ってカンジかな！", "zh": "对吧～！？谁叫琴叶那么完美嘛♪\n有一种不愧是班长的感觉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1049_p", "source_sha256": "1c971d9bc726aa9755885a6055edfe50fa1dd5789a4f60db997bac5c4640957b", "ja": "なんで琴葉の話なのに、恵美が得意気にしてるんだ？", "zh": "明明是在说琴叶，为什么是惠美在得意？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1050_020meg", "source_sha256": "896d8f68f0c5b2fffd8553c54c893763417c10acd58e94095c77074c7e999ed1", "ja": "そりゃあ友達だもん、自慢するっしょ！", "zh": "因为我们是朋友啊，当然会觉得骄傲！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1051_029umi", "source_sha256": "c3e4fa9a7df60d987d0a72d3090eb6621181773e8b7a0ce0241f1c2bb00d1d9b", "ja": "えーっ！　ずるいずるい、私も！\n私も、琴葉の友達になる～っ！", "zh": "咦～！好贼好贼，我也要！\n我也要当琴叶的朋友～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1052_029umi", "source_sha256": "17ac63f8714663e96b4a5c52cd943cf3f35cd8a056730ed5582b066099bff30e", "ja": "でも、みんながこれだけやる気なんだから……\n灼熱少女の公演、きっといいライブになるよね！", "zh": "不过，大家都这么有干劲……\n『灼热少女』的公演，肯定会是场很棒的演唱会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1053_p", "source_sha256": "83927d26abba85255c17aceb3567a8bedf764635bbe840e04f4bef3b56f5beb4", "ja": "そうだな。今から本番が楽しみだよ。", "zh": "说得对，我现在就开始期待正式演出了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_02_1054_029umi", "source_sha256": "f5d9999736f8c01c0624bf5af14f79dfa314b024f984ea9f522cb097d1b407b4", "ja": "うん！\n{$P$}、期待しててねっ☆", "zh": "嗯！\n{$P$}就好好期待吧☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
